        "title": "ICMP echo and DNS zone transfers",
        "description": "Discussed network fundamentals (2023/04/03). Ping uses ICMP echo requests and replies to test reachability; no reply does not prove a host is down. A DNS zone transfer replicates zone records between authoritative servers: AXFR is a full transfer, IXFR is incremental. Restrict transfers to authorized secondary servers."
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "create_item",
      "args": {
        "list_id": "7bd5aa3e-1f8a-41f1-a39a-d4d067b5f764",
