        "description": "Asked how to report IP addresses, ports, and a particular web server version (2023/04/03); no actual network, product, version, or results supplied. For an authorized inventory, AI suggested `nmap -p 80,443 -sV --version-all -oN web-servers.txt <target-network>`. `--version-all` tries every version probe; it does not filter for one version. Filter the results separately, include any known nonstandard web ports, and verify uncertain versions against host inventory. No need to edit the probe file simply to look for a specific version."
      }
    }
